    "keywords": "Model binding reads data from the HTTP request and populates action method parameters and properties. By default it searches in order: route values → query string → request body . With [ApiController] , complex types default to [FromBody] and simple types default to [FromRoute] or [FromQuery] . Explicit binding source attributes let you override the default: [FromBody] reads JSON from the body (one per action), [FromQuery] reads from the URL query string, [FromRoute] reads from route segments, [FromHeader] reads from HTTP headers, and [FromForm] reads from multipart/form-data. [FromBody] reads JSON/XML request body — only one [FromBody] per action [FromQuery] binds query string parameters: /products?page=2&size=10 [FromRoute] binds route segments: /products/{id} [FromHeader] binds HTTP hea"
